# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Security Awareness Training Program
**Document ID**: SEC-008
**Classification**: Internal
**Last Updated**: January 2025

---

## Program Overview

MedSync Health's Security Awareness Training Program educates all employees on security best practices, compliance requirements, and their role in protecting company and customer data.

---

## Program Objectives

| Objective | Measure |
|-----------|---------|
| Reduce human-caused security incidents | < 5 per year |
| Achieve training completion | 100% within 30 days |
| Reduce phishing susceptibility | < 5% click rate |
| Build security culture | Employee feedback score > 4.0 |
| Maintain compliance | HIPAA, HITRUST requirements met |

