## Training Content

### Security Fundamentals

| Module | Topics |
|--------|--------|
| 1. Security Culture | Why security matters, our responsibilities |
| 2. Password Security | Strong passwords, MFA, password managers |
| 3. Phishing & Social Engineering | Identifying threats, reporting |
| 4. Physical Security | Badge use, tailgating, clean desk |
| 5. Data Protection | Classification, handling, disposal |
| 6. Incident Reporting | What to report, how to report |
| 7. Remote Work Security | VPN, home network, device security |
| 8. Mobile Security | Device protection, BYOD, apps |

### HIPAA Training

| Module | Topics |
|--------|--------|
| 1. HIPAA Overview | Privacy Rule, Security Rule |
| 2. What is PHI | Identifiers, examples |
| 3. Permitted Uses | Treatment, payment, operations |
| 4. Minimum Necessary | Need-to-know principle |
| 5. Patient Rights | Access, amendment, accounting |
| 6. Security Safeguards | Administrative, physical, technical |
| 7. Breach Notification | What's a breach, reporting |
| 8. Sanctions | Consequences of violations |

### Secure Coding Training

| Module | Topics |
|--------|--------|
| 1. OWASP Top 10 | Common vulnerabilities |
| 2. Input Validation | Injection prevention |
| 3. Authentication | Session management, MFA |
| 4. Authorization | Access control, RBAC |
| 5. Cryptography | Encryption, hashing, keys |
| 6. Error Handling | Secure error messages |
| 7. Logging & Monitoring | Security logging |
| 8. Secure SDLC | Security in development |

