## Phishing Simulation Program

### Program Structure

| Component | Details |
|-----------|---------|
| Frequency | Monthly simulations |
| Difficulty | Progressive (easy → advanced) |
| Templates | Real-world threat mimics |
| Provider | KnowBe4 |
| Reporting | Instant teachable moments |

### Simulation Categories

| Category | Frequency | Examples |
|----------|-----------|----------|
| Credential Harvesting | Monthly | Fake login pages |
| Malicious Attachments | Bi-monthly | Macro documents |
| Business Email Compromise | Quarterly | Executive impersonation |
| Spear Phishing | Quarterly | Targeted attacks |
| SMS Phishing (Smishing) | Quarterly | Text message lures |

### 2024 Phishing Results

| Quarter | Sent | Clicked | Reported | Click Rate |
|---------|------|---------|----------|------------|
| Q1 2024 | 3,600 | 216 | 2,412 | 6.0% |
| Q2 2024 | 3,600 | 180 | 2,628 | 5.0% |
| Q3 2024 | 3,600 | 162 | 2,772 | 4.5% |
| Q4 2024 | 3,600 | 151 | 2,916 | 4.2% |
| **2024 Avg** | — | — | — | **4.9%** |

### Click Rate Trend

| Year | Click Rate | Target |
|------|------------|--------|
| 2022 | 12.5% | < 10% |
| 2023 | 7.2% | < 7% |
| 2024 | 4.9% | < 5% |
| 2025 Target | — | < 3% |

### Phishing Response

| Outcome | Action |
|---------|--------|
| Clicked | Immediate training module (5 min) |
| 2+ Clicks (90 days) | Manager notification |
| 3+ Clicks (year) | Mandatory additional training |
| 5+ Clicks (year) | HR involvement, remediation plan |
| Reported | Positive reinforcement |

